# skill-optimizer

Apply the skill-optimizer skill when the request matches its scope.

Capabilities:
- score skill description routing evidence
- evolve description candidates reflectively
- emit an apply-ready description proposal

Stop when: Skill description optimization proposal emitted with held-out evidence, or an explicit no-defensible-change verdict; target skill untouched; completion criteria checked.
